  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_ex03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8dbb1275a5ec7efcef12c5db1ee9e5bd6dfa8e883ceca944df03619a851099c4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这次，是肚子上被开了个洞吧？被那个感觉很酷的老头？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错没错。我可是最前排观看的，看得一清二楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你觉得是什么？会是替身吗？还是特效？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不不，不可能，完全不可能。你亲眼看看这段录像就知道了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔。这也太逼真了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再说了，大帝的替身？这也太旷世罕见了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上一次呢？我记得是他在独自一人购物的时候，被突然窜出来的暴徒用弩枪贯穿了脑袋......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那可做不到提前排练。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有汐斯塔的时候。音乐节上那次，私底下还有过无数人去找过他的麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那时候我也在，为了能碰碰运气见到他，我特地订了和他们就隔了一条街的酒店，可热闹了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他不是个歌手吗？就算有钱了点，也不至于这么招人记恨吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是你不清楚他的行事风格。先说好，我真的很佩服他，但在树敌这方面，他大概也是全泰拉为数不多的天才。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听说昨晚企鹅物流的仓库发生了事故。他从火焰里冲出来，根本不像受了伤的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很久以前有人目睹他在贫民窟被榴弹还是炸药一类的东西直接命中，第二天毫发无伤地出现在地下酒吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这都不算什么了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊。但是脑袋被榴弹砸了个包。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......明明是榴弹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来，哥伦比亚的音乐界最动荡的那会，有传言他被人枪杀在了街头，引起了巨大的轰动来着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是被毒杀了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！那时候我在哥伦比亚旅游......我本来以为我这辈子都没法再见到偶像了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是他活下来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "活下来了，还单枪匹马去找过场子。说是要为那些年轻人报仇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么情况？不死身？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "应该有不少假新闻吧？媒体可不能全信哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但命够硬是肯定的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道，也许把他捆在火山口，让天灾来对付他才有用吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我怎么感觉就算这样他也活得下来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是啊，我甚至能想象到他对着喷发的火山爆粗口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还会很押韵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......算啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁让他是大帝呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
